A fork of the MedusaKenrelProject

Author of this fork/repository/kernel is not responsible for any damage caused by this modifications.

Why;
- Overclock CPU
- Compile it
- Get some experience

How to install;
MODDED;
- Grab the latest "medusa-modded.zip" from releases
- Flash
- Enjoy
UNODDED;
- Grab the latest "medusa-unmodded.zip" from releases
- Flash
- Enjoy

Requirements;
- Android 10
- TWRP
- Snapdragon 425
- J4+
- U6/S6 Bootloader
Recommendations;
- Good binning
- 3/32GB version

!IMPORTANT!

If you want to flash magisk as well, please use the v23 .zip way, otherwise it will most likely bootloop or hang on splash
